# Collect frames from the camera topics and turn them into candidates and an obstacle map.

# Throw away everything already buffered and wait for a whole window of new frames, sized by
# cloud.yaml's fresh_collect. Set this once the vehicle has moved: frames taken before the move
# saw the scene from somewhere else, and blending them into the window puts the handle in two
# places at once.
bool fresh
---
CloudResult cloud
---
string COLLECTING=collecting
string PROCESSING=processing
string stage
uint32 frames_collected
